ECS Fargate + ALB + Auto Scaling Lab
Architecture
================================================================
Internet → Application Load Balancer → Target Group → ECS Service → Fargate HTTPD Tasks

1. Create ECS Cluster

Go to:

Amazon ECS → Clusters → Create cluster

Use:

Plain Text
Cluster name: harish-httpd-cluster
Infrastructure: AWS Fargate

Create the cluster.
=======================================================
2. Create HTTPD Task Definition

Go to:

ECS → Task definitions → Create new task definition

Example:

Plain Text
Task family: harish-httpd-task
Launch type: AWS Fargate
Operating system: Linux
CPU: 0.25 vCPU
Memory: 0.5 GB

Container:

Plain Text
Container name: httpd
Image: httpd:latest
Container port: 80
Protocol: TCP

Because we're using httpd:latest, ECR isn't required.
