5. Create Target Group

For Fargate, this is very important:

Plain Text
Target type: IP addresses
Protocol: HTTP
Port: 80
Health check path: /

Do not choose Instance target type for this Fargate service.

We discovered this during your lab because the earlier target group had Instance as its target type, while the Fargate service needed an IP target group.
=============================================
6. Create ECS Task Security Group

A better security design is to have separate security groups.

ALB Security Group
Plain Text
Inbound:
HTTP 80
Source: 0.0.0.0/0
ECS Task Security Group
Plain Text
Inbound:
HTTP/TCP 80
Source: harish-alb-sg

This creates:

Internet → ALB SG → ECS Task SG

Rather than exposing your Fargate container directly to the internet.
