11. Manual Scaling

We then changed the service's desired count.

Go to:

ECS → Cluster → Service → Update service

Change:

Plain Text
Desired tasks:
1 → 3

After deployment:

Plain Text
Desired: 3
Running: 3
Pending: 0

The target group then showed multiple healthy Fargate task IPs.

This demonstrated horizontal scaling.
