Most important troubleshooting lesson

If:

ALB works but target shows Unhealthy / Request timed out

check these first:

ECS task is RUNNING
Container listens on correct port, here 80
Target group uses IP for Fargate
Target group health check uses correct path, here /
ECS task security group allows port 80 from the ALB security group
ALB and ECS are using compatible VPC/subnets
